          <li>Optionally set a future <strong>Schedule Send Date &amp; Time</strong> — scheduled announcements are sent automatically by a background job at the scheduled time, you don't need to be online</li>
          <li>Manage sent announcements: view, edit, delete, and restore from the Trash</li>
        </ul>
